     "type": "text",
     "props": {
      "html": "<h2>Making God’s Difference, putting children first</h2>"
     },
     "style": {},
     "d": {
      "x": 1,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 22,
      "h": 2
     },
     "m": null
    },
    {
     "id": "m0294",
     "type": "text",
     "props": {
      "html": "<p>TreeHouse at St. Paul’s is a Christ-centered daycare and early childhood facility dedicated to providing the best Christian education and childcare to the community of Oakville and the St. Louis area.</p><p>Our staff shows the love of God in all that they do, which is visibly reflected in the classroom. By showing love and a trustworthy attitude, our children learn to love and trust others as well. Our staff accepts children’s angry feelings, understands their fears, and forgives them for their mistakes so each child can learn to handle anger, fear, and guilt. All emotions are a part of life, and we strive to enhance each child’s emotional intelligence while meeting their individual needs.</p><p>Childcare is such a substantial part of you and your child’s day, and our teachers are committed to providing consistent communication and accommodating the needs of busy families. Because of this, TreeHouse has become a tradition for many households in the area. Many children currently enrolled in our program are siblings and, in some cases, children of past students.</p>"
     },
     "style": {},
     "d": {
      "x": 1,
      "y": 3,
      "w": 10,
      "h": 20
     },
     "m": null
    },
    {
     "id": "m0295",
     "type": "image",
     "props": {
      "src": "/media/treehouse-1-5-1.jpg",
      "alt": "",
      "fit": "cover",
      "href": "",
